.git
.gitignore
docs
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
# ...except the modules that survive only as bytecode. Without these the image builds
# and then fails to import app.base_block.loader. See RECONSTRUCTION.md.
!backend/app/base_block/*.pyc
!backend/app/transformation/*.pyc
!backend/app/validation/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
backend/requirements-dev.txt
backend/app/static
sample
# 2.9 GB of pattern files. The catalog's own templates ship in assets/, and the full
# library is mounted at /srv/templates only if ad-hoc template selection is wanted.
/templates
*.md
!README.md
